From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SpreadZhao <spreadzhao@outlook.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:18:32 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] input/tablet: support tablet-v2 pen input and output mapping

Adapt tablet-input for dwl 0.9 and wlroots 0.20. Forward pressure and tilt,
emulate pointer input for clients without tablet-v2 support, and map devices
to optional outputs.

Based on tablet-input by pi66:
https://codeberg.org/dwl/dwl-patches/src/branch/main/patches/tablet-input
---
